    "detailed_description": "Battle Sudoku allows players to play Sudoku with up to 8 other players or as a single player.  There are various themes, game modes and (in our opinion) some motivating music to add a twist on the usual genre.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures include:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Single or Multiplayer (up to 8 players)<br />\r\n- 5 Levels of board difficulty<br />\r\n- 2 Game modes (Classic and Battle Royale)<br />\r\n- Set time limits per game<br />\r\n- Toggle basic assist helper for obvious errors<br />\r\n- Each board is completely unique (and generated algorithmically at play time)<br />\r\n- Intuitive number and helper number selection<br />\r\n- Basic themes with additional zen like water effect<br />\r\n- Banging Soundtrack (or not - your choice)<br />\r\n- Multilingual Support<br />\r\n- Continue existing game facility<br />\r\n- Some fun avatars<br />\r\n- Keep track of your top 10 scores for all level of difficulties",
